          b: "No, the Accountant's action is not justified. Under AS-12, grants related to depreciable fixed assets must be treated as deferred income and recognised in the P&L on a systematic basis, in proportion to the depreciation charged on those assets over their useful life - the ₹25 lakh subsidy cannot be credited to the P&L in full for 2023-24.",
