          b: "Subscription Account:\nTo Balance b/d (arrears): ₹28,000[cite: 1]\nTo I & E A/c (income for 2024-25) [Bal. fig]: ₹1,79,500[cite: 1]\nTo Balance c/d (advance): ₹12,500[cite: 1]\nBy Balance b/d (advance): ₹4,000[cite: 1]\nBy R & P A/c (received): ₹2,08,000[cite: 1]\nBy Balance c/d (arrears- ₹1,600 × 5): ₹8,000[cite: 1]\nTotal: ₹2,20,000[cite: 1]",
