          b: "Gross Taxable Salary = ₹4,16,000 (Basic ₹2,40,000 + Bonus ₹20,000 + DA ₹48,000 + Entertainment Allowance ₹78,000 + RFA perquisite ₹30,000; employer's PF contribution is Nil taxable, being to a Statutory PF). After Standard Deduction ₹50,000 and Entertainment Allowance deduction (Sec 16(ii), government employee) ₹5,000, Gross Total Income = ₹3,61,000. After 80C deduction ₹60,000 (LIC premium ₹30,000 + own SPF contribution ₹30,000), Total Income = ₹3,01,000. Tax = ₹50 (5% slab on ₹1,000 above ₹3,00,000), fully offset by Rebate u/s 87A → Tax and cess payable = Nil.",
