          b: "Claims (less Re-insurance) to appear in the Revenue Account = ₹51,88,000. Working: Claims paid (Direct ₹46,70,000 + Reinsurance ₹7,00,000 + Surveyor's fee ₹35,000 + Legal expenses ₹45,000 = ₹54,50,000) less Claims received from re-insurers ₹2,30,000 = ₹52,20,000; plus Outstanding claims at year-end (₹8,12,000+₹53,000−₹1,13,000 receivable = ₹7,52,000) = ₹59,72,000; less Outstanding claims at year-start (₹7,63,000+₹87,000−₹66,000 receivable = ₹7,84,000) = ₹51,88,000.",
