          b: "Flexible Budget Totals: 60% Capacity (300 units) = ₹1,15,000; 80% Capacity (400 units) = ₹1,42,000; 100% Capacity (500 units) = ₹1,69,000 (comprising proportionate Materials/Labour/Expenses/Variable Factory & Admin Expenses, plus constant Fixed Factory Expenses ₹16,000 and Fixed Administrative Expenses ₹18,000 at every level).",
